LID - e8270
AB  - Wandering spleen results from abnormal ligamentous laxity and is often 
      symptomatic, presented with abdominal pain and other non-specific symptoms. These 
      symptoms, make the diagnosis very difficult and most of the times even 
      impossible. As such, keeping in mind this pathology, can make further 
      complications less frequent.
