PG  - 152-4
AB  - Wandering spleens are rare clinical entities found more commonly in females. We 
      report a young female patient found to harbour a pelvic spleen. The literature 
      regarding this rare ectopia is reviewed. The wandering spleen should be 
      considered in the differential diagnosis of pelvic masses.
