TI  - Traumatic rupture of a wandering spleen in a child: case report and literature 
      review.
PG  - 348-50
AB  - A case of traumatic rupture of a wandering spleen in a 5-year-old girl is 
      presented. To our knowledge, this is the first reported case of such injury in a 
      child. The splenic injury was managed nonoperatively. The etiology and management 
      of wandering spleen is discussed.
