TI  - [Torsion of an ectopic spleen as a cause of acute abdomen].
PG  - 445-8
AB  - A case of torsion of an ectopic spleen is presented. Diagnosis was obtained by 
      echography, CAT and arteriography. We review the cases reported in literature and 
      discuss the diagnostic and therapeutic problems raised by this rare condition as 
      the cause of acute abdomen as well as for the differential diagnosis of abdominal 
      masses.
