TI  - [Volvulus of a mobile spleen. Apropos of a case diagnosed in the preoperative 
      period by ultrasonography].
PG  - 520-2
AB  - A case of splenic volvulus, a rare complication of a rare malformation, mobile 
      spleen, is reported, only 150 similar cases being documented in the literature. 
      The diagnosis can be suspected preoperatively by ultrasound imaging. Different 
      etiologies of this lesion are discussed and the various complementary 
      examinations allowing preoperative diagnosis described.
