TI  - Torsion of a wandering spleen: CT appearance.
PG  - 1201-4
AB  - A case of wandering spleen with torsion of the splenic vascular pedicle and 
      pancreatic tail is presented. The entity was diagnosed and evaluated 
      preoperatively with various imaging modalities (ultrasound, nuclear medicine, and 
      CT) as well as visceral angiography.
