DP  - 1981 Nov
TI  - Sequential liver-spleen scanning for documentation of wandering spleen.
PG  - 528-31
AB  - An additional case of wandering spleen is reported. A brief review of the 
      etiology of this entity, as well as various findings obtained with nuclear 
      imaging of the spleen, is presented. The authors discuss the relevance of 
      repeated spleen scans to the clinical decision making process. Particular 
      significance is paid to preservation of the spleen to maintain immunologic 
      competence.
