DP  - 1975
TI  - Splenic-gonadal fusion. A case report.
PG  - 163-5
AB  - A case of splenic-gonadal fusion is described. In this case, as in most cases 
      reported previously, the malformation was discovered accidentally. An ectopic 
      spleen attached to the left testis is a rare differential diagnosis to left-sided 
      testicular tumour.
